  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An easy-to-use, smooth, buildable cream bronzer with a dewy finish that melts into skin for a warm, sunkissed glow or natural definition.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Radiant</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Cream</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Vitamin E: Antioxidant moisturizes the skin.</p><p>- Coconut Emollient: Visibly softens and smoothes skin.</p><p>- Blurring Powders: Absorbs excess oil and create a long-lasting finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-For best results use REFY Duo Brush (sold separately) to apply Cream Bronzer.</p><p>-Blend in a circular motion underneath cheekbones and across high points on the face including the top of the forehead and center of the nose.</p><p>-For more coverage or deeper color, repeat application.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Hydrogenated Microcrystalline Cera (Hydrogenated Microcrystalline Wax), Silica, Polysilicone-11, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Synthetic Wax, Cera Microcristallina (Microcrystalline Wax), Pentaerythrityl Tetrabehenate, Caprylyl Methicone, Tridecyl Trimellitate, C10-18 Triglycerides, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Tocopheryl Acetate, Phenoxyethanol, Alumina, Laureth-12, Caprylyl Glycol, Aluminum Hydroxide, Triethoxycaprylylsilane. [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491 (Iron Oxides), CI 77492 (Iron Oxides), CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), &nbsp;CI 42090 (Blue 1)]</p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An easy-to-use, smooth, buildable cream bronzer with a dewy finish that melts into skin for a warm, sunkissed glow or natural definition.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Radiant</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Cream</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Vitamin E: Antioxidant moisturizes the skin.</p><p>- Coconut Emollient: Visibly softens and smoothes skin.</p><p>- Blurring Powders: Absorbs excess oil and create a long-lasting finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-conte